     "szComment": "LATER-- \r\n\r\nThere's a soft breeze in the air.  \r\n \r\nA blood petal rests in Player’s palm. It lingers for just a moment... before disintegrating into the wind.  We push ourselves up on our elbows, sweep our eyes across the horizon.  \r\n \r\nOur mindscape is empty. Serene. And so quiet. \r\n\r\nPlayer stands. WIDE SHOT. We're alive. And alone. ",
